        "created_at": "2013-10-25T14:12:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I could give it a go, unless someone else wants to run the story.I don't know if we would want a more serious story or a silly one, mine have always been with my daughter so they always involved kittens, dragons, princesses, little bear and lots of silliness.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I was going to volunteer you, anyways. Right now, we have:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>StoryTeller: phantaskippy</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Players:</p>\n<p>BluehairedMeerkat</p>\n<p>Silverleaf</p>\n<p>Me</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Anyone else want in?</p>",
